    <h2>9. Erroneous, Extraneous, and Whimsical Covenants (Memorialization of <code>#govbot</code> Project Lore)</h2>
    <p><em>The Parties hereby stipulate and agree to the following entirely erroneous, non-essential, and operational lore provisions derived from the <code>#govbot</code> Slack record. In the event any court of competent jurisdiction in Cook County, Illinois, or the State of California determines that any subsection of this Article 9 is legally erroneous, absurd, or unenforceable, such subsection shall be severed immediately without affecting the validity or enforceability of Articles 1 through 8 or Articles 10 through 14:</em></p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>9.1 The “Brick Phone” Geometry &amp; Mascot Aesthetic Deadlock:</strong> The Parties acknowledge an unresolved design dispute regarding the hand-drawn GovBot mascot featuring small eyes and ground shadows. While the Managing Member (acting under the alias <em>“Adam from 17th and Wood, Cornelius, [retired] CPA”</em>) formally advocates for a <strong>brick-shaped mascot</strong> optimized for users accessing legislation on “brick phones” alongside fifty-six (56) jurisdictional mascot variants (“sort of like America”), Transferee <strong>Edwin Chalas Cuevas</strong> has entered a formal objection on the record (<em>“I am not a brick shape fan tbh”</em>), proposing instead CGP Grey-style stick figures or a librarian-style bot wearing glasses so as to avoid looking like a bell. Transferee <strong>Nate Gross</strong> further reserves the right to object to patriotic top hats (<em>“rah rah America”</em>) in favor of two-color favicon legibility, while <strong>Frankie S.</strong> and <strong>Taha Husain</strong> endorse a top-hatted <em>Schoolhouse Rock</em> hybrid. No economic distributions shall be withheld on account of mascot shape.</li>
      <li><strong>9.2 The Qamaria Yemeni Coffee Cancellation &amp; Brown Line Transit Protocol:</strong> The Parties stipulate that all scheduled in-person synchronization meetings at <strong>Qamaria Yemeni Coffee</strong> are perpetually subject to unilateral, same-day cancellation whenever <strong>Sarta J</strong> catches a bug or pivots to remote livestreaming via Google Meet (<code>meet.google.com/irz-ywwd-idt</code>). Furthermore, no Transferee shall be held in breach of fiduciary or collaborative duty for transit delays on the CTA Brown Line near Irving Park, arriving slightly tipsy from corporate networking events, or acknowledging that ninety percent (90%) of modern employment consists of networking.</li>
